  "question": {
    "text": "The mass of a non-volatile, non-electrolyte solute (molar mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>) needed to be dissolved in 114 g octane to reduce its vapour pressure by 75 %, is:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>37.5</mn><mi> </mi><mi>g</mi></math>",
